{"type":"message","id":"711ac2fc","parentId":"ed654a19","timestamp":"2026-05-23T23:45:10.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both requests returned \"Unauthorized\" - the API key might be wrong, or there's some other issue with the authentication.\n","thinkingSignature":"544814969e654c852ba98d2dbf5a954e1490f8134d4891fb1555835244f037eb"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个请求都返回 `Unauthorized`。API Key 或认证方式可能有问题。\n\n请问这个平台的认证机制是什么？是 Bearer token 还是其他 header（如 `X-API-Key`）？或者你能否确认一下 API_KEY 的正确性和平台的认证方式？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":171,"output":76,"cacheRead":13792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14039,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779579907773,"responseId":"06616f044d5c4a8b6377dd6b95f127a9"}}
